self.KB_CONTENT["card:758397"]={"id":"card:758397","ty":"card","sourceId":"758397","title":"『供應廠商資料建立作業』中的『隨貨附發票 (MA056)』為何？","ver":"iGP","topic":"進貨","keywords":["進貨","發票","廠商","供應"],"y":"other","answer":"* 如果打勾，表示進貨時一定要輸入發票資料，否則不可存檔。","links":[],"pdfText":"","pdfPages":0,"pdfChars":0,"merged":[],"file":"kb-cards.jsonl"};
