self.KB_CONTENT["card:780954"]={"id":"card:780954","ty":"card","sourceId":"780954","title":"『合併實際與預算比較財務報表』中的『選擇比較期數 (N1)』為何？","ver":"GP4以上","topic":"實際","keywords":["實際","合併","預算","比較"],"y":"other","answer":"* 可選擇要比較「一期」、「二期」、「三期」、「四期」、「五期」。","links":[],"pdfText":"","pdfPages":0,"pdfChars":0,"merged":[],"file":"kb-cards.jsonl"};
self.KB_CONTENT["card:780455"]={"id":"card:780455","ty":"card","sourceId":"780455","title":"『IPSR17 預付購料費用明細表』中的『選擇確認狀態 (C 01)』為何？","ver":"GP4以上","topic":"明細表","keywords":["明細表","費用","狀態","作廢"],"y":"other","answer":"* 計有四種選擇Y.已確認 (『核』)、N.未確認 (『 』)、V.作廢 (『廢』) 及全部 (不須篩選)。","links":[],"pdfText":"","pdfPages":0,"pdfChars":0,"merged":[],"file":"kb-cards.jsonl"};
